# ratstack.sh Open Graph image, favicons, and HTML shell

`assets/ratstack-logo.svg` remains the source. The Open Graph image keeps the full wordmark. The square icons crop the pictorial rat-and-stack mark from the same SVG so it remains recognizable at 32 pixels.

## Re-render from the repository root

Prerequisites: ImageMagick 7 as `magick` and the macOS SF Rounded font at `/System/Library/Fonts/SFNSRounded.ttf`.

```bash
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p apps/mischief/public

magick -background '#262829' -density 768 assets/ratstack-logo.svg \
  -resize 480x /tmp/ratstack-logo-og.png

magick -size 1200x630 xc:'#262829' \
  /tmp/ratstack-logo-og.png -gravity center -geometry +0-70 -composite \
  -font /System/Library/Fonts/SFNSRounded.ttf \
  -fill '#FAF5E9' -pointsize 34 -kerning 1.5 \
  -gravity center -annotate +0+190 'ratstack.sh' \
  -strip -define png:color-type=2 apps/mischief/public/og.png

magick -background '#262829' -density 1200 assets/ratstack-logo.svg \
  -resize 1200x /tmp/ratstack-logo-hi.png

magick /tmp/ratstack-logo-hi.png \
  -gravity west -crop '45%x100%+0+0' +repage \
  -resize 360x360 -gravity center -background '#262829' -extent 512x512 \
  -strip -define png:color-type=2 apps/mischief/public/icon-512.png

magick apps/mischief/public/icon-512.png \
  -filter Lanczos -resize 32x32 \
  -strip -define png:color-type=2 apps/mischief/public/favicon-32.png

magick identify \
  apps/mischief/public/og.png \
  apps/mischief/public/icon-512.png \
  apps/mischief/public/favicon-32.png
```

Expected dimensions:

- `og.png`: 1200 × 630
- `icon-512.png`: 512 × 512
- `favicon-32.png`: 32 × 32

## HTML shell template

The Worker should use this shell only when content negotiation prefers `text/html`. `{{PLAIN_TEXT_BODY_HTML_ESCAPED}}` must be the same agent-first body returned by the plain-text representation after escaping `&`, `<`, and `>` for HTML. Do not maintain a second prose version.

```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>rat-stack — one capability, every surface</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="An Effect-first TypeScript template where one schema-typed capability projects to CLI, HTTP, MCP, and code mode."
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="rat-stack — one capability, every surface" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="An Effect-first TypeScript template where one schema-typed capability projects to CLI, HTTP, MCP, and code mode."
    />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://ratstack.sh/og.png" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://ratstack.sh/" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="rat-stack — one capability, every surface" />
    <meta
      name="twitter:description"
      content="An Effect-first TypeScript template where one schema-typed capability projects to CLI, HTTP, MCP, and code mode."
    />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://ratstack.sh/og.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="512x512" href="/icon-512.png" />
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        background: #262829;
        color: #faf5e9;
        font: 16px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      }
      body {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        max-width: 78ch;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3rem 1.25rem;
      }
      pre {
        margin: 0;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font: inherit;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <pre>{{PLAIN_TEXT_BODY_HTML_ESCAPED}}</pre>
  </body>
</html>
```

## Verification

ImageMagick reported the expected dimensions. Each final PNG was opened and inspected:

- `og.png`: full mark is crisp and centered with generous charcoal space; `ratstack.sh` is legible below it.
- `icon-512.png`: pictorial rat-and-stack mark is centered and crisp.
- `favicon-32.png`: the silhouette and lime stack layer remain recognizable at native size.

The template was exercised through a temporary local HTTP server on 2026-09-21. A real `curl -H 'Accept: text/html'` response contained all seven required tokens: `<title>`, `og:title`, `og:description`, absolute `og:image`, `og:url`, `twitter:card=summary_large_image`, and the plain-text body inside `<pre>`.

Repeat against the prototype once it serves the shell:

```bash
curl -fsS -H 'Accept: text/html' http://localhost:PORT/ > /tmp/ratstack-shell.html
rg '<title>|og:title|og:description|og:image|og:url|twitter:card|<pre>' /tmp/ratstack-shell.html
```

After deployment, run the production URL through an Open Graph debugger and confirm that it fetches `https://ratstack.sh/og.png` as a 1200 × 630 image. That deployed check cannot run before the Worker exists.
